        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert AI product communication agent.\n\nSynthesize this Pull Request update:\nTitle: {{ $('GitHub PR Trigger').item.json.body.pull_request.title }}\nBody: {{ $('GitHub PR Trigger').item.json.body.pull_request.body }}\nCommits: {{ JSON.stringify($('Get Commits').all().map(i => i.json)) }}\n\nNotion Search Results: {{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nTasks:\n1. Extract Features and Bug Fixes.\n2. Pick the BEST matching Notion page ID from the search results to update. If none fit well, output null.\n3. Draft a developer-focused Slack announcement for #product-updates.\n\nReturn ONLY a raw JSON object matching the following structure. Do NOT include markdown blocks, do NOT write backticks:\n{\n  \"notion_page_id\": \"<page_id_or_null>\",\n  \"features\": [\"feat 1\", \"feat 2\"],\n  \"bug_fixes\": [\"bug 1\"],\n  \"slackMessage\": \"Formatted message here\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
